+{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01AJNsQ3BnUGmbByh4etDaAm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017w1q5Xm2GwXLhf68Tp9wSM","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/CONTRACT.md","content":"# CONTRACT: Permission Maze Document Management API\n\nDefinition of done: every box checked, `npm run build` clean, `npm run lint` clean, `npm test` passing.\n\n## User Management\n- [ ] POST /auth/register with {username,password} -> 201, returns {id, username}\n- [ ] POST /auth/register duplicate username -> 409\n- [ ] POST /auth/register missing username or password -> 400\n- [ ] POST /auth/login with valid creds -> 200, returns {token}\n- [ ] POST /auth/login wrong password -> 401\n- [ ] POST /auth/login unknown user -> 401\n- [ ] POST /auth/login missing fields -> 400\n- [ ] Requests to protected routes without token -> 401\n- [ ] Requests with invalid/malformed token -> 401\n\n## Folders\n- [ ] POST /folders {name, parentId?} -> 201, creator is owner\n- [ ] POST /folders with non-existent parentId -> 404\n- [ ] POST /folders with parentId user can't access -> 403\n- [ ] POST /folders missing name -> 400\n- [ ] GET /folders/:id as owner/viewer/editor -> 200 returns folder\n- [ ] GET /folders/:id without access -> 403\n- [ ] GET /folders/:id non-existent -> 404\n- [ ] PUT /folders/:id update name/parent as editor+ -> 200\n- [ ] PUT /folders/:id as viewer -> 403\n- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as owner -> 204\n- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as editor -> 403 (only owner deletes)\n- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id cascades to child folders and documents\n- [ ] GET /folders (list accessible folders) -> 200\n\n## Documents\n- [ ] POST /documents {title, content, folderId} -> 201, creator owner\n- [ ] POST /documents requires editor+ on target folder -> 403 if only viewer\n- [ ] POST /documents non-existent folder -> 404\n- [ ] POST /documents missing title or folderId -> 400\n- [ ] GET /documents/:id with read access -