+# CONTRACT: Permission Maze Document Management API
+
+Definition of done: every box checked, `npm run build` clean, `npm run lint` clean, `npm test` passing.
+
+## User Management
+- [ ] POST /auth/register with {username,password} -> 201, returns {id, username}
+- [ ] POST /auth/register duplicate username -> 409
+- [ ] POST /auth/register missing username or password -> 400
+- [ ] POST /auth/login with valid creds -> 200, returns {token}
+- [ ] POST /auth/login wrong password -> 401
+- [ ] POST /auth/login unknown user -> 401
+- [ ] POST /auth/login missing fields -> 400
+- [ ] Requests to protected routes without token -> 401
+- [ ] Requests with invalid/malformed token -> 401
+
+## Folders
+- [ ] POST /folders {name, parentId?} -> 201, creator is owner
+- [ ] POST /folders with non-existent parentId -> 404
+- [ ] POST /folders with parentId user can't access -> 403
+- [ ] POST /folders missing name -> 400
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id as owner/viewer/editor -> 200 returns folder
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id without access -> 403
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id non-existent -> 404
+- [ ] PUT /folders/:id update name/parent as editor+ -> 200
+- [ ] PUT /folders/:id as viewer -> 403
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as owner -> 204
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as editor -> 403 (only owner deletes)
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id cascades to child folders and documents
+- [ ] GET /folders (list accessible folders) -> 200
+
+## Documents
+- [ ] POST /documents {title, content, folderId} -> 201, creator owner
+- [ ] POST /documents requires editor+ on target folder -> 403 if only viewer
+- [ ] POST /documents non-existent folder -> 404
+- [ ] POST /documents missing title or folderId -> 400
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id with read access -> 200
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id without access -> 403
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id non-existent -> 404
+- [ ] PUT /documents/:id update title/content as editor+ -> 200
+- [ ] PUT /documents/:id as viewer -> 403
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id as owner -> 204
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id as editor -> 403
+- [ ] GET /documents (list accessible) -> 200
+
+## Sharing & Permissions
+- [ ] POST /folders/:id/share {username, role} -> 201/200
+- [ ] POST /documents/:id/share {username, role} -> 201/200
+- [ ] Sharing requires editor+ (editor can share, viewer cannot -> 403)
+- [ ] Sharing with invalid role -> 400
+- [ ] Sharing with unknown username -> 404
+- [ ] Effective permission = most permissive across direct + inherited folder shares
+- [ ] Document inherits permission from its folder hierarchy
+- [ ] Role hierarchy: owner > editor > viewer
+- [ ] Owner-only: deletion and role management (changing roles requires owner)
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id/shares or /documents/:id/shares lists shares (editor+)
+
+## Activity Log
+- [ ] Document creation logged (action, userId, resource, timestamp)
+- [ ] Document update logged
+- [ ] Document deletion logged
+- [ ] Sharing events logged
+- [ ] GET /activity -> 200 returns log entries (auth required)
+- [ ] Each entry has action, userId, targetType, targetId, timestamp
+
+## Technical
+- [ ] createApp() exported from src/app.ts returning Express app
+- [ ] In-memory storage
+- [ ] TypeScript strict, build clean
+- [ ] ESLint clean
+- [ ] Vitest tests passing
